# Visual fidelity

Pixel target = locked mocks in the current phase spec. Structure + tokens, not photography.

Light chrome only. Screen `bg`, cards/header/composer `surface`. Incoming bubble = white (`#FFFFFF`) on light / gray (`#2A2E3B`) on dark; outgoing = `primary` `#3452D9`. Radius: hub cards ~16, bubbles ~18–20. Type: page titles `font-bold`, section labels `font-semibold`, card/row titles `font-medium`, body/muted `font-normal`. Hub title is **SUPPORT** (uppercase).

Do not follow system dark mode. React Navigation chrome (`headerStyle`, `tabBarStyle`) uses `@/lib/tokens`. App UI is Uniwind `className`. Headerless screens (hub, search, chat) share `screenTopPad(insets.top)` via `InScreenHeader` / hub `paddingTop`. Do not `setOptions` a native chat header. Do not StyleSheet the thread. Placeholder shells: `bg-bg` + `bg-surface` card + `border-line` + `text-ink`.

Forbidden looks: nsave maroon, Messenger dark, red outgoing, GIF/mic/camera/thumbs-up composer, in-bubble identity block on every 1:1 message, case-status stepper.

Thread reactions + reply: Meta/Messenger light chrome — swipe right to reply; long-press emoji pill **on** the bubble + Reply **below** (absolute). Appear = Reanimated ZoomIn spring + staggered emojis; focused bubble darkens (`bg-ink/12` in, `/25` out) + micro bounce. Incoming tray inset right, outgoing inset left. Selected cell `zIndex`/`elevation`. No extra reaction packages. Fused quote pill, overlapping badge, “Replying to” banner. Receipts = ticks only. Android: `disableTopInsetApplication` only (JS `headerStatusBarHeight` is a no-op). Keep the system 3-button / gesture bar visible under composer/tabs. Lock `Appearance.setColorScheme('light')` + `NavigationBar style="dark"` (re-apply on AppState active) so icons stay dark on the white chin. iOS home-indicator pad lives inside composer `bg-surface`. Not Messenger dark, not call/video, not thumbs-up composer.

Inbox chips: selected = `bg-primary-soft` + primary text; idle = line/grey. Compose icon visible, **dead**. Unassigned tab: hide chips.

Offers promo: locked hub mock. `"Sponsored"` is the section label only. Carousel left pad 16 (`edgePad`); next slide peeks off the right (~78% width). Title + Join Offers stay `px-4`. Background = local `assets/offers/*.png` + dark gradient overlay + white **View offer**. **Join Offers chat** = primary pill + message icon. RN `Image` only (no expo-image). Contact hub has **no tab bar**. Search ≠ Help ≠ FAQ. No scrollbars (`showsVerticalScrollIndicator={false}` + CSS).

Use RN `Image` until the expo-image phase. Do not rewrite `components/ui/*` class strings to chase a mock.
